Representative play/demo scripts live under:

- `legged_gym/scripts/`

## Navigation Policy Interface

The upper-level navigation policy uses the existing 24D navigation observation
interface:

- first 8 values: robot/path/navigation state
- last 16 values: 4 obstacle slots
- each obstacle slot: body-frame x, body-frame y, clearance, radius

Future work should not change the policy input shape unless the user explicitly
requests a policy/interface change.

